{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/readysetsplat.gif?t=1749490146\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/WinTransparent.gif?t=1749490146\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/overview.png?t=1749490146\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Splat Splat is a &quot;skill&quot; based top-down shooter 1v1 mayhem game! Splat your friend until they can't splat no more! Then do it again and again to become the ultimate Splatter!<br>Collect coins to bid for upgrades and gain advantage over your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/ShootTransparent.gif?t=1749490146\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/ARENAS.png?t=1749490146\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/BoatsTransparentSmaller.gif?t=1749490146\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/TrainTransparentSmall.gif?t=1749490146\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/LaserTransparentSmall.gif?t=1749490146\" /></div><strong>Dynamic Arenas</strong> <br>Splat against your enemy in various dangerous battle arenas where only the strongest survive. Collect coins during battle while avoiding hazards to outsplat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/AUCTION.png?t=1749490146\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/AuctionTransparent.gif?t=1749490146\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your coins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Splatters earn coins during battles, these coins are used to bid against each other for powerful upgrades in the auction between rounds! <br> <br><strong>Upgrade your upgrades</strong> <br>Upgrades in the auction get more powerful for the underdog player, enabling comeback strategies!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/extras/CONTENT.png?t=1749490146\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full release of Splat Splat contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 &quot;Balanced&quot; Upgrade options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 Dynamic Arenas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local &amp; Online Multiplayer 1v1 or 2v2</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3104920?t=1749490146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3104920?t=1749490146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/da26584a5ef04fe70409e17e92a2fd970ad1a70b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749490146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104920/d